{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/trio-isle-durar-group-al-marjan-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":23,"crm_id":"4800","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Trio Isle","slug":"trio-isle-durar-group-al-marjan-island","display_address":"Al Marjan Island","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Durar Group","price":2330000,"display_price":"2.33M","lattitude":25.6894028,"longitude":55.7386081,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Trio Isle Interiors by Missoni is an exclusive off-plan development situated on the stunning <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/al-marjan-island/\">Al Marjan Island</a> in Ras Al Khaimah. This prestigious project is the result of a collaboration between <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-durar-group/\">Durar Group</a>, bringing together architectural excellence and world-renowned interior design by Missoni. The development comprises three elegant towers offering a selection of <strong>1, 2 and 3 bedroom apartments</strong>, along with curated retail spaces designed to elevate island living.</p><p>Residents will enjoy a refined lifestyle enhanced by thoughtfully designed amenities, including serene water features, stylish seating pods, swimming pools, a pool bar, and sunken beds. Additional offerings such as a fire pit, swim-up bar, entertainment room, spa, and beach pools create a vibrant community atmosphere. The development also caters to families with a kids’ play area, teen’s club, and dedicated office spaces, ensuring comfort, convenience, and leisure in one exceptional coastal destination.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Tri